#. Key:	Rafi01Title
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1593)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1593)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi01Title"
msgid "Collection at the Market"
msgstr "גבייה בשוק"

#. Key:	Rafi01Desc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1594)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1594)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi01Desc"
msgid "A stall owner in the Old Yafeh market stopped paying. Remind him who runs this city."
msgstr "בעל דוכן בשוק יפה העתיקה הפסיק לשלם. תזכיר לו מי מנהל את העיר."

#. Key:	Rafi01A
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1596)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1596)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi01A"
msgid "Go to the market (yellow pillar near the beach)"
msgstr "לך לשוק (העמוד הצהוב ליד החוף)"

#. Key:	Rafi01ASay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1597)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1597)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi01ASay"
msgid "Three months Itzik hasn't paid. Today he pays for all three."
msgstr "שלושה חודשים איציק לא שילם. היום הוא משלם על שלושתם."

#. Key:	Rafi01B
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1598)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1598)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi01B"
msgid "If the cops are on you, lose them"
msgstr "אם השוטרים עליך, תתחמק מהם"

#. Key:	Rafi02Title
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1601)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1601)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi02Title"
msgid "Rival Crew"
msgstr "כנופיה יריבה"

#. Key:	Rafi02Desc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1602)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1602)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi02Desc"
msgid "Some crew from out of town set up shop at Moshe's garage. On our street."
msgstr "איזה צוות מחוץ לעיר התמקם במוסך של משה. ברחוב שלנו."

#. Key:	Rafi02A
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1605)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1605)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi02A"
msgid "Drive to Moshe's garage"
msgstr "סע למוסך של משה"

#. Key:	Rafi02ASay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1606)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1606)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi02ASay"
msgid "Moshe called. Strangers in his garage, and they're not there for an oil change."
msgstr "משה התקשר. זרים במוסך שלו, והם לא באו להחליף שמן."

#. Key:	Rafi02B
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1607)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1607)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi02B"
msgid "Take out the rival crew (press Q to call the boys)"
msgstr "חסל את הכנופיה (Q כדי לקרוא לחבר'ה)"

#. Key:	Rafi02BSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1608)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1608)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi02BSay"
msgid "Nobody does business in Tel Avir without asking the Sela family."
msgstr "אף אחד לא עושה עסקים בתל אויר בלי לשאול את משפחת סלע."

#. Key:	Rafi02C
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1609)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1609)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Rafi02C"
msgid "Lose the police"
msgstr "תתחמק מהמשטרה"

#. Key:	Shira01Title
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1613)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1613)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira01Title"
msgid "Dad's Phone"
msgstr "הטלפון של אבא"

#. Key:	Shira01Desc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1614)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1614)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira01Desc"
msgid "Dad's phone is sitting in the police evidence warehouse. Get it out before they unlock it."
msgstr "הטלפון של אבא נמצא במחסן המוצגים של המשטרה. צריך להוציא אותו לפני שיפרצו אותו."

#. Key:	Shira01A
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1616)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1616)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira01A"
msgid "Get to the evidence warehouse"
msgstr "הגיעי למחסן המוצגים"

#. Key:	Shira01ASay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1617)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1617)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira01ASay"
msgid "If they read what's on that phone, all three of us go down. Me first."
msgstr "אם יקראו מה יש בטלפון הזה, שלושתנו נופלים. אני ראשונה."

#. Key:	Shira01B
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1618)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1618)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira01B"
msgid "Grab a car"
msgstr "תשיגי רכב"

#. Key:	Shira01C
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1619)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1619)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira01C"
msgid "Bring the phone to the family drop-off"
msgstr "הביאי את הטלפון לנקודת האיסוף של המשפחה"

#. Key:	Shira02Title
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1622)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1622)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira02Title"
msgid "The Witness"
msgstr "העד"

#. Key:	Shira02Desc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1623)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1623)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira02Desc"
msgid "A witness against the family is at the hospital. Shira wants to talk to him before the prosecutor does."
msgstr "עד נגד המשפחה שוכב בבית החולים. שירה רוצה לדבר איתו לפני הפרקליטות."

#. Key:	Shira02A
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1626)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1626)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira02A"
msgid "Go to the hospital"
msgstr "סעי לבית החולים"

#. Key:	Shira02ASay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1627)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1627)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira02ASay"
msgid "I'm his lawyer as of this morning. He just doesn't know it yet."
msgstr "מהבוקר אני עורכת הדין שלו. הוא פשוט עוד לא יודע."

#. Key:	Shira02B
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1628)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1628)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira02B"
msgid "Talk to the witness (stay close)"
msgstr "דברי עם העד (הישארי קרוב)"

#. Key:	Shira02BSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1629)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1629)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira02BSay"
msgid "Nobody's asking you to lie. Just to remember a little less."
msgstr "אף אחד לא מבקש ממך לשקר. רק לזכור קצת פחות."

#. Key:	Shira02C
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1630)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1630)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira02C"
msgid "Get a car"
msgstr "תשיגי רכב"

#. Key:	Shira02D
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1631)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1631)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira02D"
msgid "Take him somewhere quiet (the family drop-off)"
msgstr "קחי אותו למקום שקט (נקודת האיסוף)"

#. Key:	Shira02DSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1632)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1632)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Shira02DSay"
msgid "Seatbelt. You're no use to anyone dead."
msgstr "חגורה. מת אתה לא שווה כלום לאף אחד."

#. Key:	Omer01Title
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1636)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1636)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer01Title"
msgid "Last Delivery"
msgstr "משלוח אחרון"

#. Key:	Omer01Desc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1637)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1637)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer01Desc"
msgid "One last package for the family before the big trip. What could go wrong?"
msgstr "חבילה אחרונה למשפחה לפני הטיול הגדול. מה כבר יכול להשתבש?"

#. Key:	Omer01A
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1639)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1639)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer01A"
msgid "Get a ride"
msgstr "תשיג טרמפ"

#. Key:	Omer01ASay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1640)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1640)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer01ASay"
msgid "Rafi says it's just shoes. Nobody wraps shoes like this."
msgstr "רפי אומר שזה סתם נעליים. אף אחד לא עוטף נעליים ככה."

#. Key:	Omer01B
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1641)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1641)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer01B"
msgid "Deliver the package to Moshe's garage"
msgstr "תמסור את החבילה במוסך של משה"

#. Key:	Omer01C
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1642)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1642)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer01C"
msgid "Lose anyone following you"
msgstr "תתחמק ממי שעוקב אחריך"

#. Key:	Omer02Title
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1645)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1645)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer02Title"
msgid "Eye in the Sky"
msgstr "עין בשמיים"

#. Key:	Omer02Desc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1646)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1646)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer02Desc"
msgid "The warehouse has new guards, and they aren't police. Omer gets a look from above first."
msgstr "במחסן יש שומרים חדשים, והם לא שוטרים. עומר מסתכל מלמעלה קודם."

#. Key:	Omer02A
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1649)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1649)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer02A"
msgid "Go to the evidence warehouse"
msgstr "סע למחסן המוצגים"

#. Key:	Omer02ASay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1650)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1650)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer02ASay"
msgid "Two years in the drone unit. Finally useful for something."
msgstr "שנתיים ביחידת הרחפנים. סוף סוף זה שווה משהו."

#. Key:	Omer02B
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1651)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1651)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer02B"
msgid "Take out the guards (press Q: the drone marks them)"
msgstr "חסל את השומרים (Q: הרחפן מסמן אותם)"

#. Key:	Omer02BSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1652)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1652)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer02BSay"
msgid "Three on the ground. They haven't seen me. Yet."
msgstr "שלושה על הקרקע. הם לא ראו אותי. עדיין."

#. Key:	Omer02C
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1653)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1653)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Omer02C"
msgid "Lose the police"
msgstr "תתחמק מהמשטרה"

#. Key:	Family01Title
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1657)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1657)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family01Title"
msgid "The Handover"
msgstr "ההעברה"

#. Key:	Family01Desc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1658)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1658)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family01Desc"
msgid "Rafi has the money. Shira has the judge. They need to meet without anyone seeing them together."
msgstr "לרפי יש את הכסף. לשירה יש את השופט. הם צריכים להיפגש בלי שאף אחד יראה אותם יחד."

#. Key:	Family01A
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1663)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1663)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family01A"
msgid "Rafi: leave the envelope at the market"
msgstr "רפי: תשאיר את המעטפה בשוק"

#. Key:	Family01ASay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1664)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1664)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family01ASay"
msgid "Shira, it's at the market. Under the pomegranates. Don't make that face."
msgstr "שירה, זה בשוק. מתחת לרימונים. אל תעשי את הפרצוף הזה."

#. Key:	Family01B
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1665)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1665)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family01B"
msgid "Switch to Shira (press 2)"
msgstr "החלף לשירה (לחץ 2)"

#. Key:	Family01BSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1666)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1666)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family01BSay"
msgid "This is the last time, Rafi. I mean it this time."
msgstr "זו הפעם האחרונה, רפי. הפעם אני רצינית."

#. Key:	Family01C
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1667)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1667)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family01C"
msgid "Shira: pick up the envelope at the market"
msgstr "שירה: אספי את המעטפה בשוק"

#. Key:	Family01D
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1668)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1668)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family01D"
msgid "Deliver it to the judge's driver at the hospital"
msgstr "מסרי אותה לנהג של השופט בבית החולים"

#. Key:	Family01DSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1669)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1669)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family01DSay"
msgid "Hospital parking. Nobody remembers faces at a hospital."
msgstr "החניה של בית החולים. אף אחד לא זוכר פרצופים בבית חולים."

#. Key:	Family02Title
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1673)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1673)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02Title"
msgid "The Whole Family"
msgstr "כל המשפחה"

#. Key:	Family02Desc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1674)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1674)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02Desc"
msgid "The out-of-town crew grabbed Shira's witness and they're holding him at the evidence warehouse. If he talks, all three go down. For once, the Selas work one job together."
msgstr "הכנופיה מחוץ לעיר חטפה את העד של שירה ומחזיקה אותו במחסן הראיות. אם הוא ידבר, שלושתם נופלים. הפעם, כל האחים על אותה עבודה."

#. Key:	Family02A
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1681)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1681)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02A"
msgid "Omer: get eyes on the warehouse"
msgstr "עומר: תבדוק את המחסן מקרוב"

#. Key:	Family02ASay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1682)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1682)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02ASay"
msgid "Rafi, Shira, I found him. Back room. You're not going to like who's guarding him."
msgstr "רפי, שירה, מצאתי אותו. בחדר האחורי. לא תאהבו מי שומר עליו."

#. Key:	Family02B
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1683)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1683)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02B"
msgid "Take out the guards (press Q: the drone marks them)"
msgstr "חסל את השומרים (Q: הרחפן מסמן אותם)"

#. Key:	Family02BSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1684)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1684)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02BSay"
msgid "Everyone keeps saying I'm the baby. Watch this."
msgstr "כולם אומרים שאני התינוק. תסתכלו על זה."

#. Key:	Family02I
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1685)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1685)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02I"
msgid "Lose the police"
msgstr "התחמק מהמשטרה"

#. Key:	Family02C
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1686)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1686)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02C"
msgid "Switch to Rafi (press 1)"
msgstr "עבור לרפי (מקש 1)"

#. Key:	Family02CSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1687)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1687)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02CSay"
msgid "Good work, kid. Now they'll send everything they have. Let them."
msgstr "עבודה טובה, ילד. עכשיו הם ישלחו את כל מה שיש להם. שישלחו."

#. Key:	Family02D
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1688)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1688)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02D"
msgid "Rafi: get to Moshe's garage, their base"
msgstr "רפי: סע למוסך של משה, הבסיס שלהם"

#. Key:	Family02DSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1689)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1689)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02DSay"
msgid "They came to my street. I'm going to theirs."
msgstr "הם באו לרחוב שלי. אני הולך לרחוב שלהם."

#. Key:	Family02E
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1690)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1690)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02E"
msgid "Finish the crew (press Q to call the boys)"
msgstr "גמור את הכנופיה (Q קורא לחבר'ה)"

#. Key:	Family02ESay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1691)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1691)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02ESay"
msgid "Dad built this with his hands. Nobody takes it from us."
msgstr "אבא בנה את זה בידיים. אף אחד לא לוקח את זה מאיתנו."

#. Key:	Family02F
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1693)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1693)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02F"
msgid "Switch to Shira (press 2)"
msgstr "עבור לשירה (מקש 2)"

#. Key:	Family02FSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1694)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1694)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02FSay"
msgid "Now that you two are done shooting, let me clean this up legally."
msgstr "עכשיו, כשסיימתם לירות, תנו לי לנקות את זה לפי החוק."

#. Key:	Family02G
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1695)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1695)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02G"
msgid "Shira: meet the judge's driver at the hospital"
msgstr "שירה: פגשי את הנהג של השופט בבית החולים"

#. Key:	Family02GSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1696)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1696)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02GSay"
msgid "One signature and that warehouse never existed."
msgstr "חתימה אחת, והמחסן הזה מעולם לא היה קיים."

#. Key:	Family02H
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1697)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1697)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02H"
msgid "Wait for the signature (stay close)"
msgstr "חכי לחתימה (הישארי קרוב)"

#. Key:	Family02HSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1698)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1698)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02HSay"
msgid "I told Rafi the last time was the last time. I lied to him, too."
msgstr "אמרתי לרפי שהפעם האחרונה היא האחרונה. גם לו שיקרתי."

#. Key:	Family02J
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1700)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1700)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02J"
msgid "Come home: the family drop-off"
msgstr "הביתה: נקודת המסירה של המשפחה"

#. Key:	Family02JSay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1701)
#: Source/Mishpacha/Private/World/CityGreyboxGenerator.cpp(1701)
msgctxt "MishpachaGreybox,Family02JSay"
msgid "Sit down, all of you. Dad would have hated this. Then he'd have poured three glasses."
msgstr "שבו, כולכם. אבא היה שונא את זה. ואז היה מוזג שלוש כוסות."

